# One kick sends a pulse each way round; they annihilate on the far side. Every site fires once.
# Reference: the same network integrated independently (complex arithmetic, LSODA).
title Ring of 13, one kick
sites 13
path 1 13 kappa=0.06
link 13 1 kappa=0.06
kick 1 amplitude=2
run 1500
